#: 460713468f774e448230d8b4b97da9e3
msgid "The PixC4-Jetson is a professional-quality and NDAA Compliant Flight Management Unit (FMU), powerful single board computer and peripheral support system (USB, MIPI, Ethernet, M.2 slot, etc.) in a small form factor, designed to be integrated into end-user platforms. The term “PixC4” is derived from the Pixhawk, on which the FMU design is based (FMUv5) and C4, representing Command, Control, Compute and Communication."
